    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hina-chan's phone has broken and can't text or make calls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this game, a sort of roguelite sticker deckbuilder, you'll help Hina-chan by selecting stickers to send to her friends Nitori, Suika, and Joon to avoid suspicion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, if they ask you what you ate for breakfast, you could use a meat sticker and they'll interpret that as you saying you had meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, you could use an X sticker, which they'll interpret as you saying you didn't have anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But of course, you could also send the wrong stickers and just watch how they react instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > That might be fun too. Gather useful stickers and cards to survive all the chats, and help Hina-chan make it through all the way 'til the end! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is a Touhou Project fangame.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hina-chan's phone has broken and can't text or make calls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In this game, a sort of roguelite sticker deckbuilder, you'll help Hina-chan by selecting stickers to send to her friends Nitori, Suika, and Joon to avoid suspicion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, if they ask you what you ate for breakfast, you could use a meat sticker and they'll interpret that as you saying you had meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or, you could use an X sticker, which they'll interpret as you saying you didn't have anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But of course, you could also send the wrong stickers and just watch how they react instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > That might be fun too. Gather useful stickers and cards to survive all the chats, and help Hina-chan make it through all the way 'til the end! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This game is a Touhou Project fangame.</p>",
    "short_description": "Hina-chan's phone has broken and can't text or make calls! Use stickers to keep her friends fooled so they don't find out!",
